- Its scene tests classified a decision by its score. That reads a win on world 1 (42 of 100 seeds) as a lone world-0 win, so those tests would fail after the fix. These tests rebuild decide's worlds instead.
- Gravedigger (27) lost to the missed gamble (31), so the board play is Guy Att (33).
- There is no `const` assert of the switch: it stops the test binary compiling when the switch is off.

